Cutover: fcpublicmedia.org is canonical; check-in on it; every Wix page lands

The bare domain now serves fcpm-new and www redirects to it (done in Cloudflare on 2026-10-28). This
makes the repository agree, and closes the redirect gaps the switch exposed.

- **Canonical address**: `site/_config.yml` `url` is `https://fcpublicmedia.org`, so every canonical link
  and absolute URL names it.
- **Check-in**: `site/_data/checkin.yml` names `https://fcpublicmedia.org/check-in/`. The QR is
  regenerated (it decodes to that), and the kiosk's artifacts are rebuilt. The podcast door's code,
  `mint-claim.py`'s default site and `npm run test:live` follow. Codes printed for `new` keep working.
- **Redirects**: every page in the Wix photocopy checked against this build. Six had neither a page nor a
  redirect, and each has one now: `/membership` and `/classes` (listed only with a trailing slash; Pages
  matches exactly), `/equipment`, `/donate` (to `/join/`: there's no donation page), and the two newest
  `/event-details/` pages. Only the photocopy's own `/resting` and `/thanks` remain, never Wix's.
- **docs/site.md**: the zone on Cloudflare since 2026-10-24, every mail and Microsoft 365 record carried
  over (checked against its nameserver), what each name serves, the two redirect layers, why a Pages
  domain that isn't Active answers 522, and the cutover's remaining steps.

Merge qualifications:
- [x] Playwright against a fresh build: 478 passed, 3 skipped (the failures are the standing ones)
- [x] build-kiosk 39/39; secrets, internal-publish and claim tests
- [x] no redirect leads to a missing page
- [ ] deploy (bin/deploy-site on digitization), then `curl -sI https://fcpublicmedia.org/membership` gives a 301 to /join/

Carried, not decided:
- The header's Donate button links `site.fcpm.donate`, which isn't set (donate@ is under `email`), so it
  reloads the page. It's live now.
- `sites.yml` keeps `domain: www.fcpublicmedia.org`: the station's hosts read it for the site's deploy
  root, so changing it is a station change.
- The site-worker's address (`cloud.`) is #364, merged once `cloud.fcpublicmedia.org` answers.
